{"id": "1b8f7abf-ccf3-4487-a6b3-db72d53734d3", "slug": "intelligent-notifications", "title": "Intelligent Notifications", "description": "Intelligent Notifications Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Intelligent Notifications\"\ndescription: \"Intelligent Notifications Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A855F7\"\n  secondary: \"#0F0F11\"\n  accent: \"#EF4444\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"7px\"\n  control: \"15px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Intelligent Notifications\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 171; favorites: 23; remixes: 1.\nTags: hero, section, animated, cta, effect.\n## Overview\nIntelligent Notifications Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nNotification Engine Intelligent routing. Delivered instantly. Build powerful notification workflows to reach your users across any channel. Orchestrate logic, routing, and delivery with precision. Start Building EMAIL S…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Intelligent routing. Delivered instantly..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A855F7, secondary #0F0F11, accent #EF4444, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Intelligent Notifications</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white font-['Inter',sans-serif] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-purple-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Global Layout Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 lg:py-32 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Ambient Background Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 right-1/4 -translate-y-1/2 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] max-w-[600px] max-h-[600px] bg-purple-600/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Left Column: Typography & Content -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start space-y-8\">\n\n            <!-- Eyebrow Tag -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-medium text-purple-400/80 uppercase tracking-widest reveal-el opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-bing-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>Notification Engine</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Title -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-white\" style=\"perspective: 400px;\">\n                <span class=\"block overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"block title-word translate-y-[110%] origin-bottom-left\">Intelligent routing.</span></span>\n                <span class=\"block overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"block title-word translate-y-[110%] origin-bottom-left text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-purple-600\">Delivered instantly.</span></span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Description -->\n            <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-400 max-w-md reveal-el opacity-0 translate-y-4 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                Build powerful notification workflows to reach your users across any channel. Orchestrate logic, routing, and delivery with precision.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA Button with Premium Border Gradient -->\n            <div class=\"reveal-el opacity-0 translate-y-4 pt-2\">\n                <button class=\"relative group inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-700 to-neutral-900 transition-all duration-500 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-purple-900 shadow-lg shadow-black/50\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[7px] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-opacity-70\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-200\">Start Building</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column: Animated Schema Visualization -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/3] max-w-[550px] mx-auto flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n            <!-- Scalable Container mapping DOM to SVG ViewBox -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\">\n\n                <!-- SVG Connections Layer -->\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-10 overflow-visible\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4));\">\n                    <defs>\n                        <linearGradient id=\"glow-line\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\n                            <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#a855f7\" />\n                            <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#3b0764\" />\n                        </linearGradient>\n                    </defs>\n                    <!-- Exact paths mapped to DOM element coordinates -->\n                    <path d=\"M 200 130 L 200 170 L 50 170 L 50 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#glow-line)\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"schema-line opacity-80\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                    <path d=\"M 200 130 L 200 170 L 150 170 L 150 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#glow-line)\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"schema-line opacity-80\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                    <path d=\"M 200 130 L 200 170 L 250 170 L 250 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#glow-line)\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"schema-line opacity-80\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                    <path d=\"M 200 130 L 200 170 L 350 170 L 350 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#glow-line)\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"schema-line opacity-80\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Central Hub Node (Center: X:50%, Y:33.33%) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[33.33%] left-[50%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 hub-node scale-0 opacity-0\">\n\n                    <!-- Vertical Light Beam Overlay -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[80%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[2px] h-[120px] bg-gradient-to-t from-purple-400 to-transparent blur-[2px] opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-[80%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[8px] h-[120px] bg-gradient-to-t from-purple-600/40 to-transparent blur-[8px] opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Hub Premium Border Container -->\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-400 via-purple-900/60 to-neutral-800/50 shadow-[0_0_50px_-10px_rgba(168,85,247,0.5)]\">\n                        <!-- Hub Inner Surface -->\n                        <div class=\"w-24 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-28 bg-[#0a0a0a]/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-purple-600/10 rounded-[15px]\"></div>\n                            <!-- Core Icon -->\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-bold\" class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl text-purple-300 drop-shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(216,180,254,0.9)] relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <!-- Notification Pulse Indicator -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-red-500 rounded-full border border-neutral-900 pulse-badge z-20 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(239,68,68,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Endpoint Nodes (Y:73.33%, X:12.5%, 37.5%, 62.5%, 87.5%) -->\n\n                <!-- Node 1: Email -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[73.33%] left-[12.5%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 schema-node opacity-0\">\n                    <div class=\"rounded-[14px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-600 to-neutral-900 shadow-2xl\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-[#0f0f11] rounded-[13px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] text-neutral-500 font-medium tracking-wide\">EMAIL</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Node 2: SMS -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[73.33%] left-[37.5%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 schema-node opacity-0\">\n                    <div class=\"rounded-[14px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-600 to-neutral-900 shadow-2xl\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-[#0f0f11] rounded-[13px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:smartphone-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] text-neutral-500 font-medium tracking-wide\">SMS</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                 <!-- Node 3: In-App -->\n                 <div class=\"absolute top-[73.33%] left-[62.5%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 schema-node opacity-0\">\n                    <div class=\"rounded-[14px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-600 to-neutral-900 shadow-2xl\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-[#0f0f11] rounded-[13px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:screen-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] text-neutral-500 font-medium tracking-wide\">IN-APP</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                 <!-- Node 4: Webhook -->\n                 <div class=\"absolute top-[73.33%] left-[87.5%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 schema-node opacity-0\">\n                    <div class=\"rounded-[14px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-600 to-neutral-900 shadow-2xl\">\n                        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 bg-[#0f0f11] rounded-[13px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] text-neutral-500 font-medium tracking-wide\">HOOK</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"body\",\n                    start: \"top 80%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal for Title\n            tl.to(\".title-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 0.9,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\"\n            })\n            // 2. Fade up supporting text and button\n            .to(\".reveal-el\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"power3.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.6\");\n\n            // 3. Schema Animations: Pop in Central Hub\n            tl.to(\".hub-node\", {\n                scale: 1,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.9,\n                ease: \"back.out(1.4)\"\n            }, \"-=0.4\");\n\n            // 4. Schema Animations: Draw SVG Connection Lines\n            const paths = document.querySelectorAll('.schema-line');\n            paths.forEach(path => {\n                const length = path.getTotalLength();\n                path.style.strokeDasharray = length;\n                path.style.strokeDashoffset = length;\n            });\n\n            tl.to(\".schema-line\", {\n                strokeDashoffset: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\",\n                stagger: 0.1\n            }, \"-=0.2\");\n\n            // 5. Schema Animations: Pop up Endpoint Nodes\n            tl.to(\".schema-node\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.6,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"back.out(1.2)\"\n            }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n            // 6. Continuous Pulse Animation for the red badge\n            gsap.to(\".pulse-badge\", {\n                scale: 1.3,\n                opacity: 0.4,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "intelligent-notifications.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/intelligent-notifications.jpg", "source_name": "intelligent-notifications-DESIGN.md", "views": 249, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T22:23:26.106484+00:00"}